{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"stars":1},1],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"sections":1},[2,8],{"title":3,"pages":4},"",[5],{"title":6,"slug":7},"Introduction","index",{"title":9,"pages":10},"berm",[11,14,17,20,23,26],{"title":12,"slug":13},"Overview","berm/overview",{"title":15,"slug":16},"Writing a Program","berm/writing-a-program",{"title":18,"slug":19},"The Guest API","berm/guest-api",{"title":21,"slug":22},"The Manifest","berm/manifest",{"title":24,"slug":25},"Publishing a Program","berm/publishing",{"title":27,"slug":28},"Running the Service","berm/service"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"slug":1,"title":2,"description":3,"toc":4,"html":15,"prev":16,"next":19},"berm/publishing","Publishing a Program","A program is one file, so it travels as one OCI layer with no tarball around it.",[5,9,12],{"depth":6,"id":7,"text":8},2,"the-artifact","The artifact",{"depth":6,"id":10,"text":11},"one-digest","One digest",{"depth":6,"id":13,"text":14},"credentials","Credentials","\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>berm-oci\u003C/code> pushes a program to an OCI registry and pulls it back:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reference\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> berm_oci\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reference\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ghcr.io/org/example:v1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> berm_oci\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Registry\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reference, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">berm_oci\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Access\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Write\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digest \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wasm, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">manifest)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>A host that pulls from a registry deploys a reference; \u003Ccode>bermd\u003C/code> takes the image\nitself, so it never talks to a registry, holds no credentials, and restores from\n\u003Ccode>--root\u003C/code> on start without a network.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-artifact\">\u003Ca href=\"#the-artifact\">The artifact\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"schemaVersion\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mediaType\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"artifactType\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/vnd.berm.program.v1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"config\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mediaType\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/vnd.berm.manifest.v1+json\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"digest\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:…\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"layers\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [ { \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mediaType\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/vnd.berm.program.v1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"digest\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:…\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } ]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>The config blob is the \u003Ca href=\"../manifest/\">\u003Ccode>.berm.abi\u003C/code>\u003C/a> section carried out of the\nimage byte for byte, so what a registry serves cannot disagree with what the image\nholds. The tools, their schemas and the README are one blob, and reading them\nnever means pulling the program.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Nothing about the program is repeated in annotations. Only\n\u003Ccode>org.opencontainers.image.source\u003C/code> and \u003Ccode>.revision\u003C/code> are set, from\n\u003Ccode>GITHUB_REPOSITORY\u003C/code> and \u003Ccode>GITHUB_SHA\u003C/code> when a build has them, which is what makes\nGHCR show a package against its repository.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-digest\">\u003Ca href=\"#one-digest\">One digest\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Because the layer is the image and nothing else, the layer's digest is sha256 of\nthe image — the same hash a host reports for the deployed program, carrying the\nregistry's \u003Ccode>sha256:\u003C/code> prefix:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$ shasum -a256 target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/fixture.wasm\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">222890c498ed28f4bf60670a223141489d9879020bd1890111b8c11ac79fa31d\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>A pulled image is checked against the digest the registry advertised before it\ngoes anywhere, so a registry that serves the wrong bytes is caught by the deploy\nrather than by the model.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"credentials\">\u003Ca href=\"#credentials\">Credentials\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>GITHUB_TOKEN\u003C/code> is the registry credential; in a workflow that pushes, it needs\n\u003Ccode>permissions: packages: write\u003C/code>, and locally \u003Ccode>GITHUB_TOKEN=$(gh auth token)\u003C/code> does\nthe same. \u003Ccode>~/.docker/config.json\u003C/code> is not read. A pull from a public repository\nneeds none.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>BERM_REGISTRY_MIRRORS\u003C/code> reaches a registry at another address, as\n\u003Ccode>name=endpoint\u003C/code> pairs separated by commas. A host in a container pulls what was\npushed to \u003Ccode>localhost:5001\u003C/code> from \u003Ccode>http://registry:5000\u003C/code> with\n\u003Ccode>BERM_REGISTRY_MIRRORS=localhost:5001=http://registry:5000\u003C/code>.\u003C/p>",{"title":17,"slug":18},"The Manifest","berm/manifest",{"title":20,"slug":21},"Running the Service","berm/service"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
